WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
I want to swallow this huge sum of money secretly

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,520
But I can't get the big boss's personal phone number at all.

3
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:06,360
The front desk refused to transfer me.

4
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,400
Two students who are still studying

5
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:11,770
I don’t know how to resist when someone treats me like a soft persimmon.

6
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:13,810
Go, take the contract

7
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:16,930
Come with me to meet the new manager

8
00:00:16,930 --> 00:00:17,890
It makes sense now, right?

9
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:20,050
I heard that you want to deduct more than one million yuan in commission from Zhao Qian

10
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:21,050
Which onion are you?

11
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:23,450
He didn't even have a flag and came here to show off for a little amusement park.

12
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:24,850
My name is Zhang Tong

13
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:28,830
A few days ago, the owner of the 18th building was bought for a total of 45 million.

14
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:31,140
Now Zhao Qian is my personal secretary

15
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:32,840
I stood up for him

16
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:34,280
Do you think you are qualified?

17
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:36,080
It turns out to be the distinguished Mr. Zhang.

18
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:37,640
But you really misunderstood

19
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:39,360
The agreement signed by the former manager and Zhao Qian

20
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:40,960
I only wrote down the appearance fee of two thousand per day

21
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:44,040
It was clearly written in black and white and there was no mention of sales commission at all.

22
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:46,000
The former manager said it in front of everyone in the university

23
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,280
As long as I attract customers to subscribe

24
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:49,040
2.5% settlement commission for all cases

25
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:50,600
What's the use of verbal promises?

26
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,800
Everything about the company's finances depends on the contract.
